{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Qh4KygOsYi1793616152.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產山村道分行副區域營業經理石修文表示，分行新近促成跑馬地金光大廈買賣成交，單位為低層D室，實用面積456平方呎，採2房間隔，望街景，最新以623萬元成交，折合實用呎價13,662元。</p><p> </p><p>石修文表示，新買家為外區客，心儀跑馬地旺中帶靜，居住環境舒適，見上址價格合理，遂決定入市自用。據了解，原業主於2010年以448萬元購入單位，持貨16年，是次沽出賬面獲利175萬元，單位升值約39%。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T08:23:37.669860+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":195,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T07:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T17:38:20.443607+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T08:18:51.378553+00:00","content_hash":"1316dbffa4488b46aede0aedc35300dbbff67916dfaefc1ec446df25c47e6619","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T08:23:37.669860+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}